{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll your dice, grow your fortune, and build the ultimate collection of powerful dice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dice Roller Incremental, each dice roll earns you money, which you can spend to upgrade your existing dice, unlock new ones, and discover more ways to boost your income. Start small, then snowball your way into massive gains as your dice become stronger, faster, and more rewarding with every upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing gameplay, with incremental progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ different dice skins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the satisfying loop of rolling, upgrading, and progressing.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3855570?t=1756430080","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855570/79b82cd5f6efcc9c6d481ee2a28d9e4db1246f89/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756430080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855570/a61b01fe5a715feca6ec7aeaa67d8207800056ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756430080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855570/a61b01fe5a715feca6ec7aeaa67d8207800056ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756430080","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll your dice, grow your fortune, and build the ultimate collection of powerful dice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dice Roller Incremental, each dice roll earns you money, which you can spend to upgrade your existing dice, unlock new ones